  "headline": "Surabaya, Tangerang And Banyuwangi Receive Regional 2026 Awards",
  "seoTitle": "Surabaya, Tangerang and Banyuwangi Receive 2026 Awards",
  "metaDescription": "Regional governments including Surabaya, Tangerang, and Banyuwangi have been recognized with various national awards for innovation and sustainability.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Surabaya was honored with two national awards at the 2026 Smart City Forum for digital service innovations.",
    "Tangerang Regency received recognition for its implementation of green industry practices.",
    "Banyuwangi was awarded for its poverty reduction initiatives presented at the 2026 Smart City Forum."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Various regional governments and institutions across Indonesia have been recognized through a series of national awards during late November 2026. The awards cover a wide range of achievements, including municipal innovation, environmental sustainability, and social governance. Surabaya’s municipal government received two accolades at the national Smart City Forum for its advancements in digital public services and economic stability technology. Similarly, Banyuwangi earned recognition for its poverty relief programs highlighted during the same forum. In Banten, the Tangerang Regency government was commended for its leadership in developing green industry practices. These honors reflect ongoing efforts by local administrations to improve urban planning, social welfare, and environmental management. The recent ceremonies emphasize the national commitment to incentivizing regional development through competition and recognition of best practices in public policy implementation.",
